title: "What Near-Perfect Accuracy Does and Does Not Show on the UCI TCGA Pan-Cancer RNA-Seq Dataset: Leakage, Equivalence, Conformal Reliability and Data Efficiency"
abstract: "Leakage audit, equivalence testing, calibration/conformal reliability and data-efficiency study on the UCI TCGA Pan-Cancer RNA-Seq dataset (801 tumours, 20,531 genes, five cancer types). Research work carried out as part of the 6-Month Industrial Training & Certification Program in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, jointly offered by IIT Ropar (https://www.iitrpr.ac.in/) and NIELIT Ropar (https://www.nielit.gov.in/ropar/), under MeitY, Govt. of India."
